# Phase 6 – Step 1: keep the Docker build context minimal and secret-free.
# Allow-list approach: ignore everything, then re-include only what the image needs.
# A new file (e.g. another .env variant) is therefore excluded by default.
*

!requirements.txt
!app.py
!models.py
!llm.py
!project_lib.py
!agents/
!ui/
!quality/
!prompts/
!observability/

# Never ship caches, even inside allowed folders.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
